+**********************************************************************
+*
+* File resbund.cpp
+*
+* Modification History:
+*
+*   Date        Name        Description
+*   02/05/97    aliu        Fixed bug in chopLocale.  Added scanForLocaleInFile
+*                           based on code taken from scanForLocale.  Added
